# DELACHE critical rules

Source of truth: `AGENTS.md`. **NO EXCEPTIONS.**

## Must follow

- Verify every SQL column/table against `database/schema.sql` — never assume names
- DB changes: create `database/migrations/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_*.sql` (TiDB/MySQL 8). Do not edit schema by hand as the change vehicle; after apply, update `database/schema.sql` to match
- Components never call axios/fetch — only dispatch Redux thunks and select state
- Fix root causes of type/bugs immediately — no patches
- API handlers stay in `api/index.ts` (Vercel serverless). Update `swagger.yaml` with API changes
- `api/index.ts` must not import runtime values from `shared/` or `lib/` (Vercel ESM 500). `import type` only; keep inlined copies in sync with `shared/` / `lib/`
- Update `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` when design-relevant UI changes land
- i18n: new user-visible strings → both `client/locales/en/translation.json` and `es/translation.json` via `t()` — never hardcode
- Prefer reusable components/utilities over one-offs; avoid breaking changes
- Mobile-responsive, engaging UI for frontend work
- Review chat history before changing code — do not reintroduce fixed issues
- If requirements are unclear, **ask the user first**
- Package manager: **npm only** (never pnpm/yarn)

## Testing (mandatory)

New/changed product behavior needs Vitest coverage (happy path + edges). Extract non-trivial rules to `shared/`. Run `npm run test` and `npm run typecheck` before done. Pure styling may skip tests; ask if unsure.
